<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this must usefull for petclass, put the pet attack in number 1, and stand in a good place where you can reach must of the monsters.let the macro do its work. :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rappelz</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>